{
  "vcon": "0.4.0",
  "uuid": "eae7daa6-dbc5-8c18-bc1e-38af0349d8ba",
  "created_at": "2026-02-18T10:08:03-05:00",
  "subject": "Inbound call, City Clerk",
  "parties": [
    {
      "name": "Beverly Gardiner",
      "role": "resident",
      "validation": "synthetic"
    },
    {
      "name": "Owen Haskell",
      "role": "clerk",
      "validation": "synthetic"
    }
  ],
  "dialog": [
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-18T10:03:52-05:00",
      "duration": 5,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "City Clerk's office, this is Owen. How can I help you this morning?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-18T10:03:57-05:00",
      "duration": 7,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Yeah, hello. I need to renew my dog's license. And I lost the tag. Don't know where it went."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-18T10:04:04-05:00",
      "duration": 10,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Okay, that's all right. Let me make sure I have this right. You want to renew a dog license, and the old tag is lost. Is that correct?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-18T10:04:14-05:00",
      "duration": 6,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "That's it. Beverly Gardiner. I'm at 63 Old Beach Road, down by Easton's Beach."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-18T10:04:20-05:00",
      "duration": 8,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Thank you, Mrs. Gardiner. Give me just a moment to bring up the record. Is the license in your name?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-18T10:04:28-05:00",
      "duration": 7,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Yes, my name. Been in my name for years. The dog's a beagle mix. Getting on, like me."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-18T10:04:35-05:00",
      "duration": 6,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Alright. And is this a renewal for the same dog, nothing changed? No new dog?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-18T10:04:41-05:00",
      "duration": 6,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Same dog. Hold on. Did you say something? I heard somebody say I'd have to wait."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-18T10:04:47-05:00",
      "duration": 4,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "No, ma'am, I haven't said anything yet. I'm still here."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-18T10:04:51-05:00",
      "duration": 9,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Well somebody did. [pause] Oh. That's my television. Hang on. I'll turn it down. That's the way it goes. Talking to the weather lady."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-18T10:05:00-05:00",
      "duration": 3,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "That's fine, take your time."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-18T10:05:03-05:00",
      "duration": 4,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Okay. It's off. Sorry about that. Go ahead."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-18T10:05:07-05:00",
      "duration": 11,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "No trouble at all. So, you asked about the tag. We can issue a replacement tag when you renew. You'd just let us know the old one is lost."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-18T10:05:18-05:00",
      "duration": 6,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Do I have to come in? Or can I just tell you now and be done?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-18T10:05:24-05:00",
      "duration": 12,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "For this one, I'd recommend coming in to the office. What I'd like you to bring is the rabies vaccination certificate for the dog, the current one, and a photo ID."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-18T10:05:36-05:00",
      "duration": 3,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "The rabies paper. From the vet."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-18T10:05:39-05:00",
      "duration": 7,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Yes, ma'am. The certificate from the vet showing the rabies shot is current. That's the main thing."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-18T10:05:46-05:00",
      "duration": 7,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "I got a card from the vet. Is that the same thing? It's a little card, kind of pink."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-18T10:05:53-05:00",
      "duration": 13,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "That might be it. If it says the dog's name, the date of the vaccination, and when it expires, that should do. If you're not sure, the vet's office can print you a copy."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-18T10:06:06-05:00",
      "duration": 7,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Okay. And the old license? I don't have it either. I think it's in a drawer. Maybe."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-18T10:06:13-05:00",
      "duration": 8,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "If you find it, bring it along. If not, don't worry, we can look up the record on our end."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-18T10:06:21-05:00",
      "duration": 7,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "And is there something about spayed? The dog's fixed. Do I need a paper for that too?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-18T10:06:28-05:00",
      "duration": 11,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Good question. If the dog is spayed or neutered, bring proof of that as well if you have it. It can be on the same vet paperwork sometimes. Check the card."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-18T10:06:39-05:00",
      "duration": 5,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "So the pink card, and my ID. And the spayed thing. Anything else?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-18T10:06:44-05:00",
      "duration": 10,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "That's the list. The vaccination certificate, proof the dog is fixed if you have it, your photo ID, and the old tag or license if you find it."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-18T10:06:54-05:00",
      "duration": 5,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Wait, now. You said license and tag. Aren't those the same thing?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-18T10:06:59-05:00",
      "duration": 11,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Close, but not quite. The license is the record and the paper. The tag is the metal piece that goes on the collar. You'll get a new tag when you renew."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-18T10:07:10-05:00",
      "duration": 6,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Huh. Okay. I thought they were the one thing. Where do I go, then? City Hall?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-18T10:07:16-05:00",
      "duration": 7,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Yes, ma'am, City Hall, and you'd come to the City Clerk's office. We're open weekdays during business hours."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-18T10:07:23-05:00",
      "duration": 8,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Alright. So I come in, bring the pink card and the ID. Did you say the old tag? I don't have it."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-18T10:07:31-05:00",
      "duration": 7,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Right, the old tag isn't required. If you can't find it, just tell us it's lost. That's all."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-18T10:07:38-05:00",
      "duration": 8,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Okay. I think I got it. Pink card, ID, the spayed thing. I'll write it down. Hold on, where's my pen."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-18T10:07:46-05:00",
      "duration": 3,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Take your time. I'll wait."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-18T10:07:49-05:00",
      "duration": 6,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Got it. Thank you, Owen. That's the way it goes, I lose one thing every week."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-18T10:07:55-05:00",
      "duration": 6,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Happens to everybody. Have a good day, Mrs. Gardiner. We'll see you at the office."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-18T10:08:01-05:00",
      "duration": 2,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Okay. Goodbye."
    }
  ],
